              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For fleet managers across Florida, few things are more important than keeping trucks on the road and out of the shop.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Regular preventive maintenance isn't just about checking oil levels or replacing filters; it's the backbone of safe, efficient, and profitable operations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we know downtime costs money. That's why our preventive maintenance schedule for semi trucks is designed to help drivers plan ahead, reduce breakdowns, and protect their investment mile after mile.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-it-matters",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why a Semi Truck Maintenance Schedule Matters",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-it-matters"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-it-matters-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A semi truck is more than a vehicle; it's a business asset. Neglecting routine service can lead to costly repairs, fuel inefficiency, and lost time on the road. A consistent semi truck maintenance schedule helps identify small problems before they become major issues. Whether you own a single truck or manage a full fleet, preventive truck maintenance ensures:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-why-it-matters-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Longer engine life and fewer unexpected breakdowns"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Better fuel economy and performance"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Compliance with FMCSA inspection and safety standards"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Higher resale value and lower lifetime operating costs"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-service-intervals",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Recommended Semi Truck Service Intervals",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "service-intervals"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-service-intervals-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Every truck operates under different conditions, so service intervals should reflect real-world usage. Here's a general truck maintenance guide based on mileage and hours of operation:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-service-intervals-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "interval",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "5,000–10,000 MI",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "Inspect and replace engine oil and filters"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Check coolant levels and hoses"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Inspect brakes and adjust slack as needed"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Check tire pressure and tread wear"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "25,000 MI",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "Replace fuel filters"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Lubricate chassis and suspension points"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Inspect steering components"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Test battery health"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "50,000 MI",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "Inspect belts, hoses, and driveline components"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Check wheel alignment and suspension system"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Service transmission and check differential fluid levels"
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "100,000 MI",
                        "points": [
                          {
                            "text": "Perform a full preventive service inspection"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Replace air filters and hydraulic fluids"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Conduct a complete diagnostic scan"
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Review maintenance logs and update service records"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-service-intervals-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "These intervals serve as a foundation, but the semi truck service frequency should also depend on environmental factors, driving routes, and load weights. For example, Florida's humid climate and stop-and-go city routes may require shorter service intervals than long-distance highway hauls.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-reliability",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Preventive Truck Maintenance: The Key to Reliability",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "reliability"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-reliability-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Preventive maintenance isn't just about avoiding breakdowns; it's about keeping your business predictable. At Sun State International, our certified technicians follow manufacturer-recommended service schedules for International® trucks and all major brands.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-reliability-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We combine professional inspection with advanced diagnostic technology to make sure your truck is always road-ready. From oil analysis and brake checks to electrical system testing and aftertreatment services, our preventive maintenance program is built to help you:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-reliability-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Catch early warning signs before they cause downtime"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Extend equipment life cycles"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Plan your service budget with confidence"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-reliability-4-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-reliability-4",
