                      "alt": "Sun State International service advisor reviewing a maintenance work order"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-why-us",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Sun State International Is the Partner You Can Count On",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-us"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-us-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we know that for hardworking owners and operators, time is money. Our parts and service departments are designed around one simple goal: keeping your truck on the road. With convenient Florida locations, including Tampa, Sarasota, Davenport, and Brooksville, we offer:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-why-us-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "OEM-quality International® parts in stock and ready for pickup"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Skilled technicians trained in preventive truck maintenance and repair"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Fast, reliable turnaround to reduce downtime"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Transparent communication every step of the way"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Mobile service to meet you where you're at"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-us-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you service your truck with Sun State International, you're not just getting a repair; you're gaining a dependable partner who treats your business like their own.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-reliability-culture",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Building a Culture of Reliability",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "reliability-culture"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-reliability-culture-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Preventive maintenance is more than a checklist; it's a mindset. It's about protecting the investment you've built and keeping your commitments to customers. Our team's dedication mirrors that of every driver we serve: hardworking, honest, and determined to keep moving forward. Whether you manage one truck or an entire fleet, the right maintenance partner makes all the difference.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-keep-moving",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Keep Your Fleet Moving with Sun State International",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "keep-moving"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-keep-moving-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Your trucks are built to last, but only if you take care of them. Stay ahead of costly repairs and unplanned downtime with a customized preventive maintenance schedule designed for your specific routes and loads. Order genuine International® parts or schedule preventive service with Sun State International today and experience dependable care from a team that treats you like family.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
